<h1>Pronunciation</h1>
<dl><dt><dfn>arachnid</dfn></dt><dd>[uh-RAK-nid] a spider or scorpion</dd>
<dt><dfn>hyena</dfn></dt><dd>[hy-EE-nuh] a doglike African mammal</dd></dl>
<p>The word <em>gnu</em> is pronounced <code>noo</code> in English.</p>
<p>Say it aloud: <span class="pronunciation">kwiz</span>.</p>
